{"title":"The Matriarch","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Matriarch is a named <a href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch\">Harpy Matriarch</a> seen at level 34.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Matriarch</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Trollbarrow\">Trollbarrow</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-matriarch\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"harpy-talon\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/cf4d2e12bc404da2b413.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Harpy Talon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/fa7a91474cd506f51e2f.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Matriarch</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/harpy-matriarch\">Harpy Matriarch</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>34</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>145</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}